# Coverage ratchet for `dart run tool/check_coverage.dart`.
#
# Overall coverage of every non-generated file under lib/ must not drop below
# this number. Raise it deliberately as coverage grows; never lower it.
# Once coverage reaches 70.0 it stays pinned there as the floor.
#
# The metric now counts files that no test executes as 0% (see
# test/coverage/import_all_test.dart). The previous 70.0 was measured over
# loaded files only, so it is not comparable with this value.
#
# Raised from 15.62 to 19.15 by unit-tests-entry-creation-otp.
# Raised from 19.15 to 24.89 by unit-tests-sync-service.
24.89
